 "stimulus_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<br><p>For questions 1 - 4, use the following scenario.</p>\n<blockquote>\nThe relationship between the amount of time a car is parked, in hours, and the cost of parking, in dollars, can be described with a function.</blockquote>",
